    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 99,
        "text": "Hi everyone, thanks for coming. We have three plans for the new bus route. Let's compare them.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "823978287d38af597857b7f7d6c808bc8269fa4bb8815dedc04404334323c76c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 105,
        "sourceEnd": 185,
        "text": "Okay. Plan A is the cheapest. It costs two dollars. But it's slower than Plan B.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d9ee6371ffce10104165cc2e5438c278fab832412e26a761305527808549500d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 191,
        "sourceEnd": 217,
        "text": "How long does Plan A take?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "de93327f6e5261aa4654fe60df57328d40751c595847e82ac8d0e4fb9a35d4c8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 224,
        "sourceEnd": 322,
        "text": "About forty minutes. Plan B takes thirty minutes, but it's more expensive. It costs three dollars.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "93cfe0cfbcd1e811a5f919319a80d39025c84f76fd25a50b04302f1cc65dedd7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "carla",
        "speaker": "Carla",
        "sourceStart": 330,
        "sourceEnd": 439,
        "text": "I like Plan C. It's the fastest. It takes only twenty-five minutes. But it's the most expensive—five dollars.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "e3b41cdc0c68ddf802f5ebdf1d589832524c95e529d608842a97107a9e49ddf1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 445,
        "sourceEnd": 472,
        "text": "How often do the buses run?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "fbb0fe1a636fa8da3086a6f12670cf0f2cfaad352d74fd3a45c845ebdcfe4fbf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 479,
        "sourceEnd": 578,
        "text": "Plan A runs every thirty minutes. Plan B runs every fifteen minutes. Plan C runs every ten minutes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6a0b214c2f2b61a6b464026848f27acf6aba84771b5f828f26e280555c986d0f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "carla",
        "speaker": "Carla",
        "sourceStart": 586,
        "sourceEnd": 678,
        "text": "That's good. But Plan C stops far from my house. I have to walk fifteen minutes to the stop.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "e59f1622e528f1629be560f200336a111fc9abd117aa99de4b67940184a4407a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 684,
        "sourceEnd": 763,
        "text": "Plan A stops near my house. I walk only two minutes. But the bus is often late.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0eaac0937351537a06af3656ca2a119d7c214d6e232465b92f3ad9e6dfa254f3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 769,
        "sourceEnd": 847,
        "text": "Plan B is the most reliable. It's usually on time. And it stops at the market.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9a8acbb95ec91f70c30ca8fbe46614b0d8a0dddaf3a291bef6427cd94be61840",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "carla",
        "speaker": "Carla",
        "sourceStart": 855,
        "sourceEnd": 886,
        "text": "How do you go to work now, Mia?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "91170af9ab92438e05cc2dff716d6aab4079cd92eb1e8526fc5e956f8181acbd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 893,
        "sourceEnd": 982,
        "text": "I go by bike. It's faster than the bus in the morning. But when it rains, I take the bus.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "717149cc2423904c9ee14c9b1383d37f9e2a2895ca312772a6aadb2c0c72166e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 988,
        "sourceEnd": 1027,
        "text": "So, which plan is best for most people?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "8cdfebc363c5fb97dd948d563ca957b181ce4dbbaf06f75aeba85a740bd6c7a9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "carla",
        "speaker": "Carla",
        "sourceStart": 1036,
        "sourceEnd": 1100,
        "text": "Maybe Plan B. It's not the cheapest, but it's fast and frequent.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "059c72138db64cb0fcd974b22c3e32c1148d439aeaf1a4d5f20cfe42fefbc986",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1106,
        "sourceEnd": 1163,
        "text": "I agree. Plan B is a good balance. Let's write that down.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "8a58752e715b661f695d07060c8531fedb606412b4e9a4248fbbf2b8341465ac",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
